  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Meng Qiu Zhen activates Butterfly Explores Heavenly Secret after testing his limits in a heaven path dream realm. The move uses dream path investigative Immortal Gu Dream Butterfly as the core, is based on exposing heavenly secret, and is made for heaven path dream realms so it can obtain details of calamities and tribulations there in advance. It is one of the preparations Fang Yuan made for that work.",
      "chapters": [
        2311
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_dream_butterfly_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the first use, Meng Qiu Zhen knows the details of the first earthly calamity, then spends more immortal essence to use the move two further times and probe the types and scale of the next two earthly calamities. Exposing heavenly secret can only explore the next calamity and tribulation, and the cultivator cannot be too far from that next tribulation. Butterfly explores heavenly secret can probe the details of the next three calamities, with that number tied to the move’s power and the size of the heaven path dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        2311
      ],
